 "notes": "Sunset Avenue jogs at Glenway: north leg centre x~1695, south leg x~1605, recorded as two T's. Midland Avenue jogs twice: at Rutledge (west part y~3422, middle part y~3105) and at Sunset (middle part y~3101 west of Sunset, east part y~2898). St. Lawrence printed with no suffix. Two streets enter Kreis Avenue from the west plate edge, names cut: '...URY ST.' at y 4755 and '...ENTS AVE.' at y 5295. Unnamed street runs south off the plate from West 8th Street at x~358 (plate edge). McKeone Avenue widens near Glenway (west line curves). Glenway printed 'GLENWAY' (suffix not seen in strip). Brough Street printed 'BROUGH' and 'ST.' separately on the same street (x~390-420). Herman Elsasser and Geo. Vaughan's Estate lettering are estate names. Street at x~2483 (with pipes) lies outside strip+300. | Sunset Avenue jogs at Glenway: north part (40 ft) centre x~1696, south part (50 ft) x~1591; each recorded as its own T. Midland Avenue jogs twice: y~3435 west of Rutledge, y~3105 from Rutledge to Sunset, y~2890 east of Sunset (T's on both sides at Rutledge and at Sunset). Rutledge Street is printed 'ST.' north of Midland and 'RUTLEDGE' south; same street. McKeone printed 'Mc KEONE' + 'AVENUE'; Kreis printed 'AVENUE' (north) and 'KREIS' (south). St. Lawrence printed 'ST. LAWRENCE' with no suffix in this strip (Avenue assumed); 60 ft west of Brough, 30 ft east. Kreis Avenue T's from the west at y~4757 (name cut by plate edge, '...URY ST.') and y~5295 ('...ENTS AVE.'), both '?'. Street stub south of W. Eighth at x~368 runs off the plate, name not printed ('?'). Brough Street ends at St. William Avenue (only a lot line continues south). Texas Avenue does not reach Liberty."
